OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-immigration protester admits
OL,4,Abreaking county ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who calls himself 'The Hotel
OL,7,FInvestigator' has admitted breaking a
OL,8,Fcommunity protection notice banning him
OL,9,Ffrom Surrey after attending an
OL,10,Fanti-immigration protest.
OL,12,FAnthony Barnes, 45, from London,
OL,13,Fchanged his plea to guilty at Staines
OL,14,FMagistrates Court on Thursday, having
OL,15,Finitially pleaded not guilty in
OL,16,FNovember.
OL,18,FBarnes, who runs the YouTube account AY
OL,19,FAudits which has 160,000 subscribers,
OL,20,Fbroke the notice by attending a protest
OL,21,Foutside a hotel in Horley on 23 August
OL,22,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
